abstract: "Exact integer certificates excluding 280-point caps in AG(7,3), using cited low-dimensional classification results. Includes full proofs, Python and C++ verifiers, a separate exhaustive audit, and a 236-point cap. AI assistance and shared dependencies are disclosed in README.md and AUDIT.md."
